Ministério do Trabalho e Emprego, Brasil. [Official NR-10 history and issued texts](https://www.gov.br/trabalho-e-emprego/pt-br/acesso-a-informacao/participacao-social/conselhos-e-orgaos-colegiados/comissao-tripartite-partitaria-permanente/normas-regulamentadora/normas-regulamentadoras-vigentes/norma-regulamentadora-no-10-nr-10) · [Issued 2026 revision](https://www.gov.br/trabalho-e-emprego/pt-br/acesso-a-informacao/participacao-social/conselhos-e-orgaos-colegiados/comissao-tripartite-partitaria-permanente/normas-regulamentadora/normas-regulamentadoras-vigentes/nr-10-atualizada-2026-1.pdf).

Read the whole text applicable to the actual place/date and compare any announced future revision, including training, roles, installation evidence and risk controls. This is a Brazilian occupational requirement source, distinct from theoretical field laws, design standards, equipment instructions and a course certificate.

The 33-file-page 2026 PDF inspected on 29 October 2026 explicitly states entry into force on 1 June 2027 under article 5 of Portaria MTE 737, 29 May 2026. Publication in 2026 therefore does not mean that revision is already in force on the inspection date. Preserve the actual issued text, transition conditions and subsequent changes; do not use an old handbook as the authority for present applicability. Only external references and original explanation are supplied here.

